Date: Wed, 30 Sep 2026 15:44:37 +1000
Subject: [PATCH 36/46] test: validate guarded x87 arithmetic against FEX
 SoftFloat

Family: x87 FADD/FSUB/FMUL/FDIV/FSQRT at PC24 and PC53. Members: arithmetic register, reverse/pop/memory forms inherit existing guarded IR integration; native corpus tests arithmetic semantics. Trigger: guarded host arithmetic requires exact F80 values and RN precision constraints. Coverage: deterministic 2M cases and 58800 FCW/exception-mask/edge cases; compare accepted F80 result and all SoftFloat flags. Audit completed: yes. Native arithmetic validation passed with zero differences; emitted guest32 code and game timing remain unverified.
---
